WEBVTT

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:27.000
Young lady.  I'll bring the food to your room.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.930
She had the same eyes as that white-haired person.

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:31.980
Why would Tome-san have those?

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.110
Koito-san and Akine-san had the same eyes.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:38.990
Ouch!

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.780
They were being controlled...

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.800
...by that white-haired person.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:02.050
I called you here so you could taste the same feelings I did.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.610
She has the same eyes as him.

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:07.440
Is he still alive?

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:10.900
It looks like I've got all sorts of fun coming my way.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:14.630
Just what happened between those two?

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.550
I can't let myself lose.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.080
I have to keep on going.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.500
It's been three days since I left home.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.770
Tome-san must be worried about me.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.880
Young lady!  Please get away!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.720
I wonder what happened to Koito-san and Akine-san.

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:09.620
I'm worried about them, but I mustn't let myself get caught up with them.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.530
I can't let myself be seen by anyone right now.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.520
Times like this...

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:19.320
Back with Twenty Faces and the gang...

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.720
It didn't seem cold at all...

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.900
The old hiding spots were always so warm.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:46.000
And there was always a mission for us.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.790
We were all heading towards the same place.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.040
But...

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:08.380
I have no idea where I should be heading now.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.390
I feel so faint...

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.520
Mister...

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.300
I've been looking for you, Chizuko-kun.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.470
Akechi-san?

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:33.130
I see.  You've lost sight of your way.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:36.040
Have you been looking for him all this time?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.730
I don't plan to stop.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.800
He's quite possibly the reason I'm standing here today.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.030
What do you want to do?

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:53.060
I'm going to find him before you.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.000
Chieko, where are you?  Chieko...

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.830
Watch it!

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:19.050
Chieko...

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.240
I can't go any further.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.150
I'm so hungry...

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.640
Move, move!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.980
Outta the way!

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.730
Hold it!  You're under arrest!

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:44.890
Chieko.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.750
Hey, Chieko.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.030
Chieko!  Chieko!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.340
Chieko...

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:06.560
I see.  I'll just go on alone now.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.390
What am I thinking?!

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.390
Chieko!

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.330
Chieko...

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:47.570
Hey.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.400
Chiko called you Akechi, right?

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.080
If you're looking for her, she went that way.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.310
Have you been watching over her too?

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.490
I suppose you're waiting...

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.990
...for Twenty Faces to reappear.

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.180
Chiko's reached her limit.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.440
I'll look after her.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:10.120
No, I think she'll be fine for a bit longer.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.180
She'll lure out our prize yet.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:15.160
You look a little like the Boss.

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:17.980
That creeps me out.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.580
Chieko...

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:32.620
...where are you?

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.500
Ah, Chizuko-kun!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.370
No, it's Chieko!

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.350
Chieko!

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:48.130
I've been looking all over for you.  Come home with your big brother.

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:49.280
Akine-san?

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.530
Wait for me, Chieko!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.530
Forgive me, Akine-san.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.230
Chieko...

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.060
Come on and stand up, Akine-san.

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:11.200
You don't want to half-ass it this time, do you?

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:16.890
What was... I...

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:20.500
You were hypnotized.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.100
And not very well, I must say.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.630
Hypnotized?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.560
Come on, let's go.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.490
Huh?  Go where?

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:32.230
To the place where Chizuko-kun is headed.

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:33.820
Chizuko-kun?

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.770
W-Wait a second, Akechi-kun!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:52.390
I have to find Twenty Faces by myself, without getting caught up with anyone else.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.100
Shall I give it another try?

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.630
This is for you, Oneechan.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.870
Some white-haired person told me to give it to you.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:25.410
I'll be waiting with that cute girl who cares for you...

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.870
...on the island of his memory.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.150
Tome-san?!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:35.800
I have to think.

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:38.890
What can I think of?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:05.270
Good.  Come here, Mikamo Chizuko.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.530
I'll empty out your heart for you.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.100
Wait for me, Tome-san.  I'm coming now.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:44.870
Hi there.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.660
The reason I picked this place you already knew...

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.130
...was because I wanted to finish our fight properly.

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.380
Now we can go all out.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.290
I see.  You don't want to fight.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:16.900
Well, can you still go without fighting even after this?

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:20.930
Tome-san?!

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.470
Isn't she beautiful?

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.910
She's the spirit of the fleetingly falling flower petals.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.910
Everyone in your life will die.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.210
Just like her.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.180
Well?

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.560
Is your heart empty now?

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.070
Well?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.270
Having fun?

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:16.770
She's a woman?

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.170
It's no use.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:49.150
I know all of his secrets.

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:53.060
He's a part of me.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:57.190
He's much deeper a part of me than he is of you.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:03.150
Now shall I'll give you a body just like mine?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.210
Wouldn't that be grand?

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.820
He'd never...

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.450
Twenty Faces is dead.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.970
Forget about him.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.290
She's my shield.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.270
She's your good friend or something, isn't she?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.870
You don't want to lose your friends, do you?

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.080
Snap out of it, Koito-san!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:58.310
Quit it!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.120
Koito-san?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:05.610
Koito-san!

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:09.080
Get up, Koito-san!  Koito-san!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:15.100
You're still just a child who can't even control herself.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:19.100
Don't you see that Twenty Faces' existence is too much for someone like you?

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:23.420
The two of you will never be a good match for one another.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.110
I'm...

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:25.860
...a child!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.960
Forget about Twenty Faces!

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.240
Let it go!

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:56.010
Sir, didn't you take this boat just a short while ago?

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.400
Is that so?

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.730
Someone else must be going to the same place.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.010
Come now.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.500
I'll make you forget everything.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.060
Hey.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.790
Is this a magician's sideshow booth?

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.980
Hey, Akechi-kun.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.320
You dropped your glasses.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:35.420
I can do anything you can do.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.320
I know all your secrets.

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:39.490
I'm flattered.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.600
It's natural.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.350
You were part of me, after all.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.350
Past tense, eh?

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.520
Now you're a monster without the slightest resemblance.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.010
Shall we begin?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:54.450
Destruction.  Rebirth.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.220
Either one is fine by me.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.450
As long as it fills my void.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.910
Well, Twenty Faces?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:05.840
Ah...  Ah-ah?!  You?!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.870
You want to close the chapter on your past, don't you?

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.080
Th-That's right.  Chieko.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.170
Or rather, Chizuko-kun.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:16.190
Well then.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.430
You handle the scary one.

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:43.730
I'm grateful to you.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.660
Akechi, Twenty Faces...  Whoever you are.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:49.880
It's as if I've finally gotten back...

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.460
...the person I lost in the war.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:55.840
I'm so thankful that you brought me here!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.890
This detective is typical of the people of this country.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:03.520
His good fortune today made him forget about the sorrows of the past.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.280
No.

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.670
He's just pretending to have forgotten them.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:10.860
That's one way to live.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:14.760
You were never one to approve of such a way of life.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.200
True enough.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.180
You should be filled with hate.

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:22.790
Hate for all the things we did back then.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:27.000
Hate for all the people who covered up the stench and forgot about it.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:33.420
And you were sent into despair and went to live in the darkness.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.140
And I...

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.220
...ended up in this body.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.760
There's no logic for what someone hates.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.100
We followed our wishes and ended up like this.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:47.270
You and I.  We should have chosen different paths.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.520
What are you trying to achieve?

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:53.600
You went so far as to pretend to die and bury your existence.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.900
You even abandon your thief friends.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.520
What is it that you're trying to do?

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.240
Ah, what difference does it make.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.410
We're all going to die anyway.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.710
Boss, watch out!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.380
Why did you abandon me?

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.510
Couldn't I have gone with you?

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:24.890
I thought we'd experience everything together until the very end!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.520
That's what I wanted!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.450
Mister?

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.460
It's all right.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:53.900
It's just a bad dream.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.130
You're about to wake up.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.840
Mister?!

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:00.970
Why?

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.260
Why?!

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:08.350
Watch out!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:12.940
Boss!

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:15.350
Mister!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.220
Ah.  Ah-ah.  Ah-ah.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:30.810
Ah-ah!

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:32.810
You're...

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:33.960
...Tome-kun?

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.650
Just a second.  I'll get you out of there.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:38.610
Where's the young lady?

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:41.460
That's right!  Chizuko-kun!

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:42.470
Young lady!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.230
Ah-ah-ah!

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:45.880
They've all disappeared.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.290
Young lady...
